        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikaarei ipukat Yeosapat Yudaya, kisyak Aasia lokoku ka Aab akipuka Isirael alo Samaria. Abu iŋes kipuka Isirael ŋikaru ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
