              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, kiwuap ŋuna ewuapito papa keŋ ka toto keŋ ta ŋuna ewuapit Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat; ŋolo abu torikok Ŋisirael nasecit. ",
          "type": "text",
